# 项目约定：发布包与仓库内文本一律 LF，防止 Windows autocrlf 破坏服务器脚本
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
requirements.txt text eol=lf
VERSION text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
pytest.ini text eol=lf
